            "kind": "send",
            "message": "Build a parameterized mounting plate in model.py using build123d. Make it 100 by 60 by 4 mm, centered in X and Y with the bottom at Z=0. Put four 5 mm through-holes at centered spacings 76 mm in X and 36 mm in Y. Cut a locating notch 6 mm deep and 10 mm wide into the positive-X edge, centered in Y and through the thickness. Preserve at least 8 mm material from each hole wall to outer walls including the notch. One connected body, no extra features. Export part.step. Use inspect_cad to obtain actual geometry measurements and actual views, fix any failed checks, and finish only when accepted. Do not use run_shell to build it; inspect_cad has the configured CAD environment.",
